# UI `src/lib` structure

| Folder / file | Role |
|---------------|------|
| `api-client.ts` | `createApiClient` from `@sidui/api-client`, `handleApiError` |
| `api/admin/admin-<resource>-api.ts` | Admin CRUD wrappers (`auth: roleAdmin`) |
| `api/<feature>-api.ts` | User-facing wrappers (`auth: roleUser`) |
| `auth-client.ts` | Better Auth React client |
| `auth-session.ts` | Cached session query |
| `query-client.ts` | TanStack Query client |
| `pagination.ts` | Shared page/pageSize zod + defaults |
| `utils.ts` | `cn`, `toRouteSearch` |

## Eden wrappers

Pages import wrappers, never `apiClient` / `fetch` / `@sidui/api`.

```typescript
const { data, error } = await apiClient.api.v1.idiom.get({ query: { page, pageSize, text } });
if (error) throw new Error(error.value.message ?? '获取成语列表失败');
return data.data;
```

- Unwrap the envelope (`data.data`). Throw `Error` with the API message so `handleApiError` can toast it.
- Derive list/detail types with `Awaited<ReturnType<typeof fn>>` — do not duplicate backend TypeBox types.
- Admin functions: prefix `admin*` (`adminListIdiomsPagination`, `adminCreateIdiom`).
- Put user APIs next to `lib/api/`, not under `api/admin/` (idiom-guess currently lives under `admin/` — do not copy that).
